> Reverting [#69161](https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/69161) in Google provider - not harmful in any way, but not too useful either ([#70395](https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70395)).

Hi @shahar1 ,

While testing the Google Provider, we find out that there is a regression for the Dataform. Here is a log for that run (reducted)
```log
